### Guard that runs before resolution: `ValidateRegistrationDate` (future-date rejection)
`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/function/owner/ValidateRegistrationDate.java` (class lines 14–26, `service` at lines 16–25)

