## 3. Existing tests

There is no direct unit test of `BusinessDay`. The only test coverage is a black-box acceptance test plus a test-side re-implementation of the (holiday-aware) rule.

### Acceptance test
`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/test/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/acceptance/AcceptanceTest.java` (full file)

